00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
And not that we haven't been successful,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.040
but if you've noticed, this past few days we've been trying to do The 12 Days of Christmas,

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.420
all starting with the actual video "12 Days of Christmas."

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.960
And it's something that we've wanted to do for a while now

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.660
it's something that we've been planning.... and it's something we've been moderately successful at.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:31.000
All things considered even though I have been extremely ill the past few days

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.800
I've had a fever, body aches, chills, just general tiredness and my voice flipping in and out

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:43.000
my voice actually came back for a little bit and I was able to record a little bit but I went at it too hard

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.820
and yesterday I couldn't speak in more than a hushed whisper, I wouldn't have even been able to do this vlog

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.000
if I hadn't have spent to whole day quiet.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.500
And in fact, I kinda got everybody else sick

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.200
Uh, Tyler, Ethan, Kathryn and Amy, I got them all sick

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.000
because of whatever the hell I brought back from the UK.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.500
and if you don't know what bronchitis is

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:10.000
it an infection of the bronchial tubes in the lungs, it means you're sick and feel terrible

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.900
and you gennerally cough up a buch of unpleasent GUNK.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:17.000
All that disgustingness aside I am really happy with what we've been doing.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.200
we've been like nose to the grind stone working our asses off

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.800
despite everything! I'm so proud of everybody else

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.800
and I'm proud of myself that I've been

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:30.000
able to keep going cause it's been this drive to commit to this thing

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.520
uh  that I've wanted to do, the 12 days of Christmas

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.520
and we've been doing it very successfully

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.440
albeit, I mentioned, with a few tweaks here and there

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.820
like we, we wanted to do more challenge based stuff

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:43.920
we wanted to do more things like the ginger bread house building challenge

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.040
and we had  like building a snow-man challenge... present wrapping challenge

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.800
christmas tree decorating challenge

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.800
all with twists that make them very interesting

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:52.060
UM

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:57.220
and we weren't  able to do that because my voice just completely shut down on me it was so weird

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:00.980
because usually when I get sick, I get sick for one or two days maybe three

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.100
ah  my voice goes out cause usually it like a throat infection

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:08.740
and then it comes back and it ..it... i was sick my throat went out and then it came back

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:11.500
