00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.960
and like I said I absolutely couldn't talk yesterday.

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:22.160
and it's still a little rough today because my high range

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:27.400
*Mark screams hoarsely*

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.400
