00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:57.840
when we were also preparing to all go back to our families we're leaving in 2 days

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:02.060
all to go back to our families to celebrate christmas and we're trying to get ahead on recording.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.940
